flow-mcp movie, music, and continuity port
================================================

The TypeScript modules in src/ that begin with the "Ported from flow-mcp"
header are copied from flow-mcp:

  https://github.com/GTAI-1/flow-mcp

That address is the clone URL printed in the upstream README. The upstream
package.json sets "license" to ISC. Its "author" field is empty. The archive
contains no LICENSE, COPYING, COPYRIGHT, or NOTICE file, and the source files
have no copyright header of their own. No person's name is added here.

The ISC permission notice, as identified by that license field:

