Copyright notice upstream actually shipped: none. Keep this NOTICE and the
file headers with every copy of the ported modules. Do not strip the
flow-mcp attribution.

What was not copied: the Flow Studio panel (studio/), the dedicated Chrome
profile and Google sign-in launcher (the rest of src/chrome.ts beyond the
executable lookup), and the tools that drive Flow's page (src/flow.ts and the
studio server).

